# The last picture: the workspace the film opened with, and where to read the
# rest.
title lyna-tmux
size 134 36
pre lmux kill --all
pre rm -rf .devcontainer
chapter lyna-tmux
caption lmux create ~/src/acme-api | one command, and the workspace is yours
run lmux create . --layout trio --nested
wait 7
frame 4
caption github.com/bayoudhdev/lyna-claude-tmux | the documentation is in docs/, the releases on the repository page
frame 6
